  "description": "UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot release 2026_03 as an MMseqs2 sequence database with a precomputed index, and a table of the EC numbers, Gene Ontology terms and subcellular locations of its entries.",
  "build": "Built locally from https://ftp.uniprot.org/pub/databases/uniprot/current_release/knowledgebase/complete/uniprot_sprot.fasta.gz and uniprot_sprot.dat.gz (release 2026_03 of 02-Sep-2026). The database: gunzip -c uniprot_sprot.fasta.gz > uniprot_sprot.fasta, then, with MMseqs2 18-8cc5c, mmseqs createdb uniprot_sprot.fasta swissprot-db and mmseqs createindex swissprot-db tmp. The table: python -m alambiq.engines.swissprot_annotations uniprot_sprot.dat.gz annotations.tsv. Place the files in one directory with no other files.",
